<title>USA: Equimed sets reverse stock split.</title>
<headline>Equimed sets reverse stock split.</headline>
<dateline>STATE COLLEGE, Penn. 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>EquiMed Inc said Friday its board of directors authorized a reverse stock split.</p>
<p>Shareholders of record on July 7 will receive one new EquiMed share on or after July 14 in place of each six shares they hold, a company statement said.</p>
<p>The reverse split will reduce the company's oustanding common stock to 4.6 million shares from 27.4 million shares, EquiMed said.</p>
<p>((New York Newsdesk 212 859 1610))</p>
